#: configure_gui.py:80
msgid ""
"AMD / Intel / a VM (no NVIDIA card)? Pick 'none': no NVIDIA driver is baked "
"in, and at boot choose the first entry, 'open source: AMD / Intel', which "
"blacklists NVIDIA. The other options bake that NVIDIA driver set."
msgstr ""
"使用 AMD、Intel 或虚拟机（没有 NVIDIA 显卡）？请选择“none”，这样不会包含 "
"NVIDIA 驱动。启动时请选择第一个选项“open source: AMD / Intel”，它会屏蔽 "
"NVIDIA。其他选项会包含各自对应的 NVIDIA 驱动。"

